-- risk: additive
--
-- #2873 -- an assistant explains the setup steps and, after the person's
-- confirmation in the app, sets three of them up through the same commands
-- the step pages call, under the same permission.
--
--   read    explain_setup_step   a step (or all) as the guide defines it,
--                                with its state and what it unlocks
--   writes  set_opening_hours    set_booking_rule per changed key
--                                (workspaceSettings, as on the hours step)
--           add_closure_days     closure_days rows (workspaceSettings, the
--                                table's own write policy)
--           set_number_sequence  set_number_sequence (manageBilling)
--
-- Each write's target (mcp_target_<op>, read by mcp_target_of from 0555)
-- refuses before anyone is asked what the command would refuse, names
-- every change from -> to, and carries the revision it was computed from:
-- the stored values it reads. A proposal whose values moved is stale.

